    Lenka, no volver\xE9 a arreglar esa estupidez.\",\"parentUIDs\":[7],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Marek\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":10}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-198.700134,\"yPos\":-2711.143},\"ID\":9,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"...\",\"parentUIDs\":[8],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Lenka\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":11}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-200.300171,\"yPos\":-2591.144},\"ID\":10,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"\xA1\xA1Kael!!\",\"parentUIDs\":[9],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Marek\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":12}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-201.100159,\"yPos\":-2470.34424},\"ID\":11,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Tu
    ser\xE1s quien repare la bomba esta vez.\",\"parentUIDs\":[10],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Marek\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":13},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":14},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":15}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-189.900085,\"yPos\":-2355.1377},\"ID\":12,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Y
    espero que quede prefecta. No quiero que el apellido Kov\xE1\u0159 quede manchado
    por tu incompetencia.\",\"parentUIDs\":[11],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Marek\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":17}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-449.900269,\"yPos\":-2141.53687},\"ID\":16,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No,
    espera.\",\"parentUIDs\":[13],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":18}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-449.10022,\"yPos\":-2019.93933},\"ID\":17,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No
    lo har\xE9. No se c\xF3mo.\",\"parentUIDs\":[16],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":19}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-447.500244,\"yPos\":-1898.33752},\"ID\":18,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Apenas
    y me dejas tocar las herramientas.\",\"parentUIDs\":[17],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":26}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-442.7002,\"yPos\":-1767.13953},\"ID\":19,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Ya
    no diga tu tan preciado yunque.\",\"parentUIDs\":[18],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-197.100281,\"yPos\":-2131.13843},\"ID\":20,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"...\",\"parentUIDs\":[14],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":22}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-197.9002,\"yPos\":-2012.743},\"ID\":21,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"\xBFEst\xE1s
    seguro que quieres que lo haga yo?\",\"parentUIDs\":[20],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":23}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-198.7002,\"yPos\":-1891.14221},\"ID\":22,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Sr.
    Kov\xE1\u0159, \xBFest\xE1 seguro que hijo logre hacer un buen trabajo?\",\"parentUIDs\":[21],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Lenka\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":24}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-200.300171,\"yPos\":-1763.94324},\"ID\":23,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Se
    que ha vivido toda su vida viendolo a usted, pero no tengo muy claro que \xE9l-\",\"parentUIDs\":[22],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Lenka\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":25}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-201.900146,\"yPos\":-1639.94446},\"ID\":24,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"\xA1Tonter\xEDas,
    Lenka!\",\"parentUIDs\":[23],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Marek\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":26}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-202.700134,\"yPos\":-1507.14636},\"ID\":25,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Por
    favor, es un Kov\xE1\u0159. Estoy seguro que lo har\xE1 excelente.\",\"parentUIDs\":[24],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Marek\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":42}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-312.3,\"yPos\":-1361.54333},\"ID\":26,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Aunque
    tenga una cara amigable, sus ojos quemar\xE1n los m\xEDos si protesto por m\xE1s
    tiempo)\",\"parentUIDs\":[19,25],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":31}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":133.301086,\"yPos\":-1231.94861},\"ID\":29,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Esta
    bien...\",\"parentUIDs\":[15,28],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":32}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":129.301086,\"yPos\":-1113.54492},\"ID\":31,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Lo
    intentar\xE9...\",\"parentUIDs\":[29],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":33}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":129.301086,\"yPos\":-1006.35687},\"ID\":32,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"\xA1Oh,
    gracias Kael!\",\"parentUIDs\":[31],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Lenka\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":34}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":132.500916,\"yPos\":-884.773865},\"ID\":33,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Se
    que har\xE1s un trabajo impecable.\",\"parentUIDs\":[32],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Lenka\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":35}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":135.700745,\"yPos\":-764.784},\"ID\":34,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Y
    se que no lo piensa realmente...)\",\"parentUIDs\":[33],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":36}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":136.500916,\"yPos\":-640.7885},\"ID\":35,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Gracias,
    Sra. Krej\u010D\xED. No la defraudar\xE9.\",\"parentUIDs\":[34],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":37}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":132.5008,\"yPos\":-512.789734},\"ID\":36,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Buff...
    Espero recordarme como hacerlo.)\",\"parentUIDs\":[35],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":38}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":133.30072,\"yPos\":-386.393463},\"ID\":37,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Primero
    necesito el hierro)\",\"parentUIDs\":[36],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":39}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":130.900574,\"yPos\":-266.3975},\"ID\":38,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Se
    nos acabo hace un tiempo, por lo que se supon\xEDa que ir\xEDa a recolectar m\xE1s)\",\"parentUIDs\":[37],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":40}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":130.100525,\"yPos\":-141.599274},\"ID\":39,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Pero
    esos malditos carro\xF1eros me quitaron todo lo que consegu\xED) \",\"parentUIDs\":[38],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":41}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":130.1004,\"yPos\":-22.4055023},\"ID\":40,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Supongo
    que ir\xE9 a buscar por el refugio)\",\"parentUIDs\":[39],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":125.301025,\"yPos\":104.779961},\"ID\":41,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Creo
    que vi un poco cerca de aqu\xED)\",\"parentUIDs\":[40,43],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":28}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-280.299561,\"yPos\":-1236.71692},\"ID\":42,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"(Supongo
    que realmente nunca tuve opci\xF3n)\",\"parentUIDs\":[26],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Kael\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0}]}"
